<title>RUSSIA: ROUBLE FIXED AT 3,131 PER MARK IN MOSCOW.</title>
<headline>ROUBLE FIXED AT 3,131 PER MARK IN MOSCOW.</headline>
<dateline>MOSCOW 1997-08-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>The rouble was set at 3,131 to the German mark on the Moscow Interbank Currency Exchange (MICEX) on Tuesday.</p>
<p>				    Aug 12		  Aug 11</p>
<p> Mark rate			3,131		   3,152</p>
<p>--Moscow Newsroom, +7 095 941 8520</p>
</text>
